[Intro]

[Verse 1]
[00:53.44]There is a path that the elder folk shun
[00:58.56]Where the moss groweth black on the stone
[01:04.45]Where the antlers are nailed to the rowan tree
[01:10.27]And the rowan tree standeth alone

[01:16.38]Go thou not at the falling of light
[01:22.31]Go thou not when the owl doth speak
[01:28.33]Go thou not when thy shadow doth lag behind
[01:34.57]For the wood there is old, and the wood there is deep

[Pre-Chorus]
[01:41.06]Húnvefr, húnvefr í myrkviðr
[01:46.15]She who walketh and leaveth no track

[Chorus]
[01:52.23]She Who Walketh Between the Pines!
[01:55.13]She Who Wear'th No Face at All!
[01:58.35]She Who Counteth the Living Twice
[02:01.16]And the Second Count is Small!
[02:04.24]She Who Singeth in Tongues of Bark!
[02:07.12]She Who Reapeth What None Did Sow!
[02:10.75]Heyr oss, Skogarmóðir, heyr oss
[02:13.86]For Her name we dareth not know!

[Verse 2]
[02:28.71]Old Sveinn, he went for the hare at the dusk
[02:31.72]He carried his bow and his hound
[02:34.49]The hound came home with its tail to its belly
[02:37.66]But Sveinn was nowhere to be found

[02:40.71]They sought him three days and they sought him three nights
[02:43.56]By the cairn and the brook and the fen
[02:46.53]On the fourth day his boots they were set by the door
[02:49.60]But the boots they were empty of him

[Pre-Chorus]
[02:53.03]Húnvefr, húnvefr í myrkviðr
[02:58.20]She who countheth and counteth again

[Chorus]
[03:04.28]She Who Walketh Between the Pines!
[03:07.20]She Who Wear'th No Face at All!
[03:10.19]She Who Counteth the Living Twice
[03:13.15]And the Second Count is Small!
[03:16.21]She Who Singeth in Tongues of Bark!
[03:19.15]She Who Reapeth What None Did Sow!
[03:22.73]Heyr oss, Skogarmóðir, heyr oss
[03:25.87]For Her name we dareth not know!

[Bridge]
[03:33.86]She is the hush between the heartbeats
[03:39.53]She is the breath that is not thine
[03:45.79]She is the second shadow walking
[03:52.01]Always one step behind

[03:55.09]Look not back
[03:57.88]Look not back
[04:00.79]Look not back
[04:03.88]Look not back

[Breakdown]
[04:08.19]Sveinn looked back!
[04:10.90]Sveinn looked back!
[04:13.82]Sveinn looked back!
[04:15.76]And what looked back at Sveinn — had Sveinn's own face!

[Final Chorus]
[04:43.38]She Who Walketh Between the Pines!
[04:46.08]She Who Wear'th No Face at All!
[04:49.07]She Who Counteth the Living Twice
[04:52.14]And the Second Count is Small!
[04:55.15]She Who Singeth in Tongues of Bark!
[04:58.10]She Who Reapeth What None Did Sow!
[05:01.18]Heyr oss, Skogarmóðir, heyr oss
[05:04.78]For Her name we dareth not know!

[Outro]
[05:10.88]Go thou not at the falling of light
[05:16.73]Go thou not when the owl doth speak
[05:20.11]Húnvefr...
[05:23.07]Húnvefr...
